{"_type":"issue","id":"zeroflat-cdr","title":"Phase 1 review corrections: ValueKey consistency, ButtonBuilder type promotion, ActionDispatcher exhaustiveness","notes":"Four small corrections from 2026-05-06 code review: (1) Apply ValueKey(id) to ThemeBuilder and ScaffoldBuilder — missing, breaks Patrol finders. (2) Fix ButtonBuilder key — model.id is a getter, Dart won't promote String? to String, use local var. (3) Replace default: with explicit NONE case in ActionDispatcher switch so compiler flags unhandled cases when schema grows. (4) Collapse redundant double Brightness conversion in ThemeBuilder.","status":"closed","priority":2,"issue_type":"task","owner":"benjamin.hougland@protonmail.com","created_at":"2026-05-06T19:48:52Z","created_by":"Ben","updated_at":"2026-05-06T19:49:06Z","started_at":"2026-05-06T19:49:02Z","closed_at":"2026-05-06T19:49:06Z","labels":["area:bridge","area:renderer","type:bugfix"],"dependency_count":0,"dependent_count":0,"comment_count":0}
